      "content": "i get that, but i cant really make an appointment with my doctor before finals start next week. i just need something to get through the next few days. im not talking about a massive amount, maybe just like a coffee or two or a Red Bull if i start feeling sluggish. i havent had issues with my heart or anything before with caffeine, so surely a little bit wont do much damage? i just need that extra edge to stay awake and focused.",
